  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Security and Social Cohesion in Conflict Hotspots along Migratory Routes in Blue Nile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is to improve social cohesion and stability in hotspots along migratory routes in the Blue Nile region. The project aims to target communities recently affected by conflict to build upon existing infrastructure for peace to support local and state level peace processes aimed at interrupting recurrent cycles of violence towards meaningful and lasting engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
